th compositor effects like edge detection and halftone. 2D frame-stepped animation, \"on twos\" or \"on ones,\" is crucial for the stylistic effect.\n\n\nThe core visual element is the contrast of painterly expressionism (Earth-65 Gwen's world) and graphic elements like halftone and crosshatching, as seen with Spider-Punk. This can be integrated as either multi-universe chapters with distinct aesthetics or a unified style. The goal is the tactile hand-animated look.\n\n\nThe Spider-Verse style involves several core elements: bold ink contours, Ben-Day dots, tonal hatching, and CMYK misregistration mimicking a printing press. Also consider sharp neon streaks, holographic telemetry, and 3D speed lines with onomatopoeia and smear frames. A quick check of Blender 5.3.0 is needed for node availability.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"& \\\"D:\\\\APPs\\\\steam\\\\steamapps\\\\common\\\\Blender\\\\blender.exe\\\" -b --python-expr \\\"\\nimport bpy\\nm = bpy.data.materials.new('T')\\nm.use_nodes = True\\ns2r = m.node_tree.nodes.new('ShaderNodeShaderToRGB')\\nprint('ShaderToRGB:', s2r.bl_idname, 'backface_props:', [p for p in dir(m) if 'backface' in p or 'cull' in p])\\nng = bpy.data.node_groups.new('C', 'CompositorNodeTree')\\ncomp_nodes = []\\nfor nm in ['CompositorNodeFilter', 'CompositorNodeKUWAHARA', 'CompositorNodeKuwahara', 'CompositorNodePosterize', 'CompositorNodeLensdist', 'CompositorNodeTranslate', 'CompositorNodeSeparateColor', 'CompositorNodeCombineColor', 'CompositorNodeRLayers', 'CompositorNodeGlare']:\\n    try:\\n        n = ng.nodes.new(nm)\\n        comp_nodes.append(nm)\\n    except Exception:\\n        pass\\nprint('CompNodes:', comp_nodes)\\nvl = bpy.context.view_layer\\nprint('ViewLayer passes:', [p for p in dir(vl) if p.startswith('use_pass_')])\\n\\\"\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"10000","toolSummary":"\"Check Blender 5.3 NPR shader and compositor nodes\""}}]}
