{"step_index":133,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T07:09:50Z","input_tokens":2075,"cache_read_tokens":221649,"output_tokens":7507,"thinking":"Initial investigation reveals native NPR node support in Blender 5.3 EEVEE, specifically `ShaderNodeShaderToRGB` and the `use_backface_culling` setting. This simplifies the approach significantly, as the NPR setup might be directly implementable.\n\n\nThe native `use_backface_culling_shadow` setting eliminates double shadows with Solidify Inverted-Hull Ink Outlines. Blender 5.3 includes the `CompositorNodeKuwahara` for an Anisotropic Kuwahara painterly filter, crucial for painterly backgrounds. Available EEVEE ViewLayer passes (`use_pass_normal`, `use_pass_z`, etc.) support zero-overhead screen-space edge ink and 3D comic outlines, along with depth-driven chromatic misregistration.\n\n\nFocus is on recreating the Spider-Verse visual style, particularly the out-of-focus background's print-offset effect (Cyan/Magenta/Yellow). Anisotropic Kuwahara painterly washes will be implemented for the distant backgrounds and sky. Preparing to write a structured implementation plan, ensuring it's well-formatted with GitHub-style alerts and a Mermaid architecture diagram for clarity.\n\n\nThe Spider-Verse stylized edition will be developed in a new, strictly isolated namespace to prevent any interference with the existing project files.  The new edition will have its dedicated directory for Blender files, renders, and pipeline scripts ensuring version 5 remains untouched. The plan proposes a directory structure: `pipeline/v6_*.py`, `renders_v6/`, and `LATEST/v6_stage_anim_sv.blend` (or `v6_spiderverse/`).\n\n\nInitial plan was to build a self-contained Spider-Verse directory, but reading the existing V5 animation as input provides a non-destructive advantage. This approach ensures the established V5 scene data, with all its verified elements and keyframes, is directly leveraged. The new script, `v6_sv_style.py`, will transform the input blend file into the stylized Spider-Verse version.\n\n\nConsidering a multi-script approach for the Spider-Verse style. A composition effects script will handle ViewLayer passes, the compositor setup with pain\n<truncated 1649 bytes>\n 3D ink on the primary car components. The second layer uses compositor screen-space effects for ink lines.\n\n\nEdge detection on the normal and mist passes, modulated by distance, will create crisp ink lines for foreground elements that fade into painterly washes in the distance. Replacing Gaussian blur, focal-plane CMYK print misregistration will be implemented. This effect, proportional to distance from the focal plane, will split out-of-focus elements into offset cyan/magenta plates. A `defocus_mask` is computed using the `Z` and `Mist` passes, and the effect is applied using color separation and translation nodes. The hero car will maintain sharp registration, while background elements show print misregistration.\n\nFocusing on stylistic animation, a 12 fps frame stepping rhythm will be applied to car rig poses and FX curves on specific shots, maintaining smooth camera movement at 24 fps. This will involve converting F-curves or selectively post-sampling the data for stepped animation. Camera movement will be smooth at 24 fps, except during stylized hero orbits where the camera and car will be locked at 12 fps to prevent judder.\n\nThe plan also involves creating ink ribbons on the wing endplates and bargeboards, appearing at high speeds and fluttering, with stylized slip arcs for braking and cornering. Comic speed lines and contrast flashes will be added to the camera space during specific high-impact moments.\n\n\nThe core challenge involves managing the interplay between the car's stepped animation (12 fps) and the camera's smooth motion (24 fps), especially during chase sequences. If the car and camera move at different frame rates, the car will teleport in the camera frame. The solution is to ensure the car's world-space trajectory is synchronized with the camera's frame rate during fast tracking, using a multi-script approach. Car-local secondary animation can be stepped on twos (12 fps) to create the comic aesthetic. This will involve scripts handling world-space trajectories and local animation separately.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":true,\"Summary\":\"V6《蜘蛛侠：纵横宇宙》(Across the Spider-Verse) 风格化银石 F1 整圈企划与技术实现方案：涵盖完全隔离的 V6 目录与文件架构、Blender 5.3 EEVEE 纯 CPU 六大核心视觉支柱（ShaderToRGB 阶梯冷暖光影+半调网点+排线阴影、双层可变线宽手绘墨线、焦外 CMYK 印刷错版替代传统景深、Kuwahara 水彩表现主义远景、3D 漫画气动流线与闪白冲击帧、防抖动的局部抽帧 On-Twos 动画节奏）、三幕平行宇宙色彩剧本、声画漫画化增强及 Swarm 无冲突分工方案。\",\"UserFacing\":true}","Content":"\"# V6 企划案：《蜘蛛侠：纵横宇宙》风格化赛车短片（Spider-Verse Stylized Edition）\\n\\n基于现有已通过全量物理与视线校验的 [v5_stage_anim.blend](file:///D:/项目session/blender-supercar/LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend)（银石整圈 `90.04 s` / `2161` 帧 / `26` 机位），另起一套**完全独立、零破坏**的 **V6 风格化分支**，在 **Blender 5.3.0 EEVEE（纯 CPU）** 下复现索尼动画《蜘蛛侠：纵横宇宙》（*Across the Spider-Verse*）标志性的**“手绘美漫印刷 × 表现主义水彩 × 次世代赛博霓虹”**视觉语言。\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> **完全隔离原则**：V5 的 [LATEST/](file:///D:/项目session/blender-supercar/LATEST/)、[pipeline/v5_*.py](file:///D:/项目session/blender-supercar/pipeline/v5_anim.py) 与 [renders_v5/](file:///D:/项目session/blender-supercar/renders_v5/) 保持 **100% 只读不动**。所有 V6 代码、贴图、工程与成片独立存放在 `pipeline/v6_*.py`、`v6_spiderverse/`（工程与专属贴图）及 `renders_v6/` 下。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. 整体管线架构与数据流\\n\\n经实测探针验证，本机 **Blender 5.3.0 EEVEE** 原生具备实现《纵横宇宙》画风所需的全部核心节点：`ShaderNodeShaderToRGB`、材质背面剔除（`use_backface_culling` + `use_backface_culling_shadow`）、合成器**各向异性水彩滤镜（`CompositorNodeKuwahara`）**，以及 `Normal` / `Mist` / `Z` / `Emit` / `Cryptomatte` 多通道输出。\\n\\n```mermaid\\nflowchart LR\\n    A[\\\"只读输入<br/>LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend\\\"] --> B[\\\"pipeline/v6_sv_build.py<br/>材质漫画化 + 3D 墨线 + 气动流线/特效体\\\"]\\n    B --> C[\\\"pipeline/v6_sv_rhythm_comp.py<br/>局部抽帧(On Twos) + 多宇宙色彩剧本 + 合成器\\\"]\\n    C --> D[\\\"v6_spiderverse/v6_stage_sv.blend<br/>V6 完整可编辑交付工程\\\"]\\n    D --> E[\\\"pipeline/v6_sv_stills.py<br/>26 机位 1080p 漫画分镜样张 + 漫画分格总览图\\\"]\\n    D --> F[\\\"pipeline/render_v6_sv.py<br/>2161 帧整圈序列渲染\\\"]\\n    G[\\\"pip\n<truncated 10178 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\86052\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\1a8ac0b5-f848-4c0e-bc45-8abba2abb2e8\\\\v6_spiderverse_plan.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["thinking","tool_calls"]}
